WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:03.850
- When you go up to heaven and meet God

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:07.200
and get to ask one question

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.933
that would get answered,
what question would you ask?

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:16.632
- What kind of browser
do you have up here.

00:00:16.632 --> 00:00:19.101
(both laughing)

00:00:19.101 --> 00:00:20.184
I don't know.

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:24.190
No, I actually--
- That's (laughing).

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.890
- [Interviewee] I don't
think it's meaningful

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:26.848
to ask this question.

00:00:26.848 --> 00:00:27.681
- Okay.

00:00:27.681 --> 00:00:30.483
- But I certainly hope
we had good internet.

